{"ref":"BDB, יַ֫הַץ","hw":"יַ֫הַץ","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יַ֫הַץ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יַ֫הְצָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> in Moab, site unknown <strong>(</strong>MI <sup>19, 20</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">יהץ</span><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">יהץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.4\">Is 15:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.34\">Je 48:34</a>; c. ה loc. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָ֑הְצָה</span>, on border of territory of Amorites (under Sihon) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 21:23\" href=\"/Numbers.21.23\">Nu 21:23</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:32\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.32\">Dt 2:32</a>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּיָהְ֑צָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:20\" href=\"/Judges.11.20\">Ju 11:20</a>; called <span dir=\"rtl\">יַהֲצָ֫ה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:18\" href=\"/Joshua.13.18\">Jos 13:18</a> (assigned to Reuben); <span dir=\"rtl\">יַ֫הְצָה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:63\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.63\">1 Ch 6:63</a> (Levit. city in Reuben), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:21\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.21\">Je 48:21</a>.","next":"BDB, יהר","prev":"BDB, יהץ"}